UPDATE companies SET description='King Lumber Company operates from its headquarters in Forest, Mississippi, with a second production facility in Jasper, Texas. The company has supplied wood products for over 50 years, though an exact founding year is not publicly disclosed. Ownership structure and founder names are not specified in available sources.

The company manufactures Southern Yellow Pine dimensional lumber and decking products. Its combined facilities are capable of producing more than 45 million board feet of 1-inch Southern Yellow Pine boards annually. Standard inventory includes 1x4 and 1x6 boards in grades such as D and Better, #2, #3 GM, and #3/#4 HT, as well as 5/4x6 and 5/4x4 decking in premium and standard grades. Custom runs and special grades are available on request.

The company also manages logistics through contracts with internal and external fleets to provide quick delivery.

