UPDATE companies SET description='Kingmaker Foods operates a food manufacturing facility in Indianapolis, Indiana. The company runs a state-of-the-art plant focused on producing safe, quality fresh food products with consistent taste and innovative flavors.

The facility provides liquid and dry processing capabilities, offering scalable turnkey solutions for brands that need to produce and package liquid or dry food products at large scale. Its services span recipe development, packaging design, commercialization, shelf-life testing, nutrition labeling, and food safety and regulatory compliance. The plant is SQF Level 3 certified and GFSI-certified under the SQF code, with on-site labs and built-in quality controls. Operations comply with FDA regulations, Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP), and Hazard Analysis Critical Control Point (HACCP) plans.

Kingmaker Foods serves food brands and companies seeking contract manufacturing for liquid and dry products. Its customers include businesses that require ingredient sourcing, product development, and packaging development support.

The company emphasizes innovation, a 99% production service level, quick turnaround on time-sensitive projects, and flexibility in packaging and fill requirements. It states that its experienced team and problem-solving mentality allow it to take on challenges that others cannot.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF Level 3','GFSI','FDA','GMP','HACCP','SQF Quality Code']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Liquid processing", "Dry processing", "Recipe development", "Packaging design", "Commercialization", "Shelf-life testing", "Nutrition labeling", "Food safety and regulatory compliance", "Scalable turnkey solutions", "Ingredient sourcing", "Product development", "Packaging development", "Quality control (on-site labs)", "GMP compliance", "HACCP plans", "Traceability program", "Facility security", "Mock recalls", "Third-party audits", "R&D services"], "industries": ["Food manufacturing", "Contract manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["SQF Level 3 certified (highest food safety and quality monitoring level)", "GFSI-certified under the SQF code", "On-site labs and built-in quality controls in each location", "99% production service level target", "Quick turnaround on time-sensitive projects"], "facts_used": ["Location: Indianapolis, Indiana -> /", "Address: 7698 Zionsville Road -> /", "State-of-the-art plant -> /", "Liquid and dry processing -> /capabilities", "Scalable turnkey solutions -> /capabilities", "Recipe development, packaging design, commercialization, shelf-life, nutrition labeling, food safety compliance -> /capabilities", "SQF Level 3 certified -> /capabilities, /quality", "GFSI-certified under SQF code -> /capabilities, /quality", "On-site labs and built-in quality controls -> /quality", "FDA compliance, GMP, HACCP -> /quality", "99% production service level -> /quality", "Quick turnaround on time-sensitive projects -> /quality", "Flexibility in packaging and fill requirements -> /quali