UPDATE companies SET description='Kitchen Local, LLC was founded in 2013 in Amesbury, Massachusetts, occupying a 2,200-square-foot space Studios, a historic brick building that once housed the carriage and automotive manufacturer Chas. J. Henschel & Co. The facility sits at the intersection of the North Shore and Merrimack Valley regions, just over the New Hampshire border.

The company operates a certified shared-use commercial kitchen and storage facility, offering around-the-clock access to food entrepreneurs. Its services include kitchen workspace for food production, catering, baking, cooking classes, menu planning, training, recipe testing, photography, and product development.

The kitchen serves chefs, bakers, small-scale food producers, farmers, and cooking and nutrition instructors. These clients use the space for commercial food production, catering, baking, cooking classes, menu planning, training, recipe testing, photography, and product development. The facility fosters a collaborative community of food entrepreneurs.

