UPDATE companies SET description='Kokusai, Inc. was founded in 1969 by Shigeru Matsumoto and is headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana. The company operates as a U.S. subsidiary of the Tokyo-based Kokusai group, which reports over 300 employees worldwide and annual sales of approximately US$120 million.

