UPDATE companies SET description='Landmark Plastic Corporation has operated as a family-owned manufacturer in Akron, Ohio since 1984. The company began producing thermoformed, injection molded, and extruded plastic products for the horticulture market.

The product line spans propagation trays, packs, thermoformed and injection molded round and square pots, and hanging baskets. Manufacturing processes include sheet extrusion, thermoforming, injection molding, and in-house tooling design and fabrication. The facility also provides product development services such as CAD design, CNC and CAM milling, project management, and quality control, along with printing, labeling, coloring, and assembly. Plastic recycling is integrated into operations.

Landmark serves the horticulture industry through a network of distributors across the United States and Canada. The company also collaborates on custom product development for clients needing tailored solutions.

The company emphasizes a systematic, communicative approach that walks each project from concept through production. Its in-house tooling department and product development expertise are positioned to reduce complexity for customers, while branding services such as color offset printing and custom labeling support market-ready packaging.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection molding", "Thermoforming", "Sheet extrusion", "Product design", "In-house tooling design and manufacturing", "Project management", "Quality standards", "Plastic recycling", "Printing", "Labeling", "Coloring", "Assembly", "Packaging printing", "Color offset printing", "Custom labels", "Standard labels", "CNC milling", "CAM milling"], "industries": ["Horticulture"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CNC mills", "CAM mills"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house tooling design and manufacturing", "Product development from concept to production (CAD, CNC/CAM)", "Systematic project management with open communication", "State-of-the-art color offset printing and custom labeling", "Integrated plastic recycling"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1984, family-owned, Akron, Ohio -> /about", "Manufactures thermoformed, injection molded, extruded products -> /about", "Product categories: propagation, packs, trays, pots, hanging baskets -> /", "Capabilities: sheet extrusion, thermoforming, injection molding, product development, in-house tooling, printing, labeling, coloring, assembly -> /services", "Distributors across U.S. and Canada -> /", "In-house tooling department -> /", "CNC/CAM mills for manufacturing -> /services", "Color offset printing, custom and standard labels -> /services", "Plastic recycling -> /services", "Systematic approach, open communication -> /services", "Goal: make life easier for customers -> /about", "Headquarters address: 1331 Kelly Ave, Akron, Ohio -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evi