UPDATE companies SET description='Lincare is headquartered in Rolla, Missouri, and operates as a national provider of in-home respiratory care and durable medical equipment. The company delivers services directly to patients'' homes as well as to nursing homes and long-term care facilities across the United States.

The company''s core offerings span home oxygen therapy (stationary and portable), sleep apnea treatment with CPAP and bilevel PAP devices, nebulizer therapy for conditions such as COPD and asthma, and home INR testing for warfarin patients. Lincare also provides enteral nutrition support with trained dietitians, high-frequency chest wall oscillation therapy, powered mobility equipment including electric wheelchairs and scooters, pediatric respiratory services, pharmacy delivery, speech-generating devices, tracheostomy and suction management, and both invasive and non-invasive home ventilator care. Digital tools such as the VentCircle™ mobile app and a secure patient portal support supply ordering, usage tracking, and account management.

Lincare serves individuals with chronic respiratory conditions, sleep disorders, and mobility limitations, as well as institutional customers such as long-term care facilities. A noted business relationship includes providing sleep apnea treatment to the 500-driver fleet of warehousing and distribution company TCW through its REMsafe SLEEP® family of businesses. The company also supports Medicare beneficiaries and offers out-of-pocket options for services not covered by insurance.

Lincare states its mission is to set the standard for excellence in home respiratory care, aiming to enable patients with chronic conditions to remain engaged in life. Differentiators highlighted by the company include complimentary programs such as CareCheck™ for COPD early intervention, HeartSteps® for congestive heart failure management, and SleepEaze™ for sleep disorder education and adherence support.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Home oxygen therapy (stationary and portable)", "Sleep apnea therapy (CPAP and bilevel PAP)", "Nebulizer therapy", "Home INR testing", "Enteral nutrition therapy", "High-frequency chest wall oscillation (HFCWO)", "Powered mobility (electric wheelchairs and scooters)", "Pediatric respiratory services", "Pharmacy delivery services", "Speech-generating devices", "Tracheostomy and suction therapy", "Home ventilator therapy (invasive and non-invasive)", "Durable medical equipment supply", "Disease progression management", "Long-term care services", "Pulmonary education", "SleepEaze program", "CareCheck program", "HeartSteps program", "VentCircle mobile app", "Patient portal"], "industries": ["Durable Medical Equipment (DME)", "Home healthcare", "Respiratory care", "Sleep therapy", "Enteral nutrition", "Mobility equipment", "Long-term care facilities", "Nursing homes"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["B Medical Luna G3", "B Medical Luna II", "Drive Medical DeVilbiss Traveler Portable Nebulizer", "Drive Medical Power Neb Ultra Compressor", "Medline Industries Aeromist Compact Compressor", "Vesco Medical Q Enteral Feeding Pump"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["CareCheck\u2122 complimentary COPD early intervention program", "HeartSteps\u00ae program for congestive heart failure management", "SleepEaze\u2122 sleep disorder education and adherence program", "VentCircle\u2122 mobile app for ventilation therapy management", "Secure patient portal for 24/7 supply ordering and account access"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Rolla, Missouri -> db", "Provider of in-home respiratory care and DME -> /services", "Services: oxygen therapy, sleep apnea therapy, nebulizer therapy, INR testing, enteral therapy, HFCWO, powered mobility, pediatric, pharmacy, speech devices, trach/suction, ventilator therapy -> /services", "Digital tools: VentCircle app, patient portal -> /", "Customer types: individuals with chronic conditions, long-term care facilities, TCW fleet of 500 drivers -> db, /services", "Mission statement and differentiators (CareCheck, HeartSteps, SleepEaze) -> /services", "Equipment/product lines distributed: B Medical, Drive Medical, Medline, Vesco -> db"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Lincare is the leading provider of in-home respiratory care. We offer a wide variety of home health care services that can be delivered at home, as well as in nursing homes and other long-term care facilities.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='lincare' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Linear Fine Woodworking operates from Phoenix, Arizona, where it has been designing and building custom cabinetry, furniture, and architectural millwork for more than three decades. The company serves clients across Phoenix, Scottsdale, and the broader Southwest region.

The shop produces custom cabinetry, architectural millwork, and furniture for residential and commercial projects. A distinctive capability is the in-house production of veneer panels from rough-cut flitches, a process that yields uniformly stable panels and expands design possibilities. The team works with exotic veneers, solid woods, glass, lighting, cabling, and specialized hardware to create pieces that blend function with sculpture.

Projects range from kitchen cabinetry and wall units to home theater installations and office furniture.

Linear Fine Woodworking emphasizes its combined team experience of over 350 years and its rare in-house veneer panel manufacturing as core differentiators. The firm was founded on the goal of merging custom furniture and cabinetry with fine art, a philosophy that continues to guide its approach.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry", "Architectural millwork", "Custom furniture design and fabrication", "In-house veneer panel production", "Residential woodworking", "Commercial woodworking"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": ["Exotic veneers", "Wood", "Glass", "Lighting", "Cables", "Hardware"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house veneer panel production from rough-cut flitches", "Over 350 years of combined team woodworking experience", "Custom residential and commercial woodworking", "Integration of exotic veneers, glass, lighting, and hardware"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Linear Fine Woodworking -> db", "Location: Phoenix, Arizona -> db", "Provides custom-built cabinetry and architectural millwork -> page /", "Serves Phoenix, Scottsdale, greater Southwest -> page /", "Over 30 years of designing custom furniture, cabinetry, and millwork -> page /", "Specializes in residential and commercial woodworking -> page /", "Produces veneer panels in-house from rough-cut flitches -> page /", "Uses exotic veneers, woods, glass, lighting, cables, unique hardware -> page /", "Over 350+ years of combined woodworking expertise -> page /", "Custom manufacturer -> page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Linear Fine Woodworking is one of a very few custom manufacturers that produce veneer panels in-house from rough-cut flitches.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE s